; Rescued, not a starter: the Throne's kept wizard, the one the dark wizard KEPT beside him to the end, freed when
; he falls (.ai/endgame-castle.md decision 11). Nimue, the Lady of the Lake, who gave the king his sword and its
; scabbard and took the sword back. She opens on Spiritual Weapon in its Sword form - fixed, never chosen: the
; form she opens in is her Apotheosis's (ApotheosisCatalog VariantId, CharacterData.StartingSelection), and her
; Apotheosis is Excalibur, its final form. Her passive is the Scabbard - "whiles ye have the scabbard upon you, ye
; shall lose no blood, be ye never so sore wounded" (Malory) - no one hit takes more than a tenth of her health:
; the one axis no other wizard owns, the size of a single blow. She floats (roster.nimue, anim_sets.hover); the
; look only, her Feet collider meets water and walls as everyone's does. Her title rides the Craft line ("the Lady
; of the Lake" under her name), because her name alone does not say who she is and the whole of it does not fit a
; freed line.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
Id = "nimue"
Name = "Nimue"
Craft = "Lady of the Lake"
StartingSpellResource = ExtResource("2")
HealthModifier = 1.0
SpeedModifier = 1.0
IsUnlocked = true
StartingPassiveId = "hit_cap_10"
StartingPassiveName = "The Scabbard"
StartingPassiveDescription = "No hit deals over 10% of your max HP"
